{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7d8b2d10-9c3a-4f36-9f1b-5e2c1d7a9012",
    "name": "Sistem Perpustakaan - API Gateway",
    "description": "Skenario API melalui Gateway. Import dan pilih Sistem-Perpustakaan.postman_environment.json. Isi apiKey lokal dan username/password uji. Registrasi/login tidak memakai API Key. Login menyimpan JWT ke environment variable token; peminjaman menyimpan loanId untuk request pengembalian. POST /api/books memerlukan JWT role admin; transaksi loan memerlukan JWT pengguna.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Registrasi Pengguna",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/register",
        "description": "Membuat akun baru. Endpoint registrasi tidak memerlukan API Key agar frontend dapat memulai registrasi. Expected: 201; username duplikat: 409; input invalid: 400."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "0A. Login Pengguna dan Simpan Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (body.token) pm.environment.set(\"token\", body.token);",
              "  if (body.user && body.user.username) pm.environment.set(\"username\", body.user.username);",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Login mengembalikan token atau error yang diharapkan\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect([200, 400, 401]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
        "description": "Login pengguna. Jika berhasil, test script menyimpan JWT pada collection variable token. Expected: 200; password salah: 401; input tidak lengkap: 400."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1. GET Books - API Key Benar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Daftar semua buku melalui API Gateway. Expected: 200 jika Book Service dan database tersedia."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1A. GET Books - API Key Salah",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "wrong-api-key"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Pengujian API Key salah. Expected: 401 dan request tidak diteruskan ke Book Service."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1B. GET Books - API Key Tidak Dikirim",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Tanpa API Key dan tanpa JWT. Expected: 401. Jika JWT valid digunakan, GET buku juga diizinkan."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. GET Book by ID - Ditemukan",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{availableBookId}}",
        "description": "Ambil detail buku yang ada. Default availableBookId=2. Expected: 200."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2A. GET Book by ID - Tidak Ditemukan",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{notFoundBookId}}",
        "description": "Ambil buku dengan ID yang tidak ada. Expected: 404 { error: \"Buku tidak ditemukan.\" }."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2B. POST Books - Admin Berhasil Menambah Buku",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buku Uji Tambah\",\n  \"author\": \"Penulis Uji\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Login dengan akun yang sudah memiliki role=admin; gunakan token hasil login. Expected: 201, status buku otomatis tersedia dan ID dibuat MySQL. Akun registrasi baru ber-role user dan tidak bisa memakai request ini."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2C. POST Books - Judul Kosong",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"  \",\n  \"author\": \"Penulis Uji\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Expected: 400."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2D. POST Books - Penulis Kosong",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Judul Uji\",\n  \"author\": \"  \"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Expected: 400."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2E. POST Books - Tanpa Token",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buku Uji\",\n  \"author\": \"Penulis Uji\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Expected: 401."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2F. POST Books - Token Tidak Valid",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer invalid.token.value"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buku Uji\",\n  \"author\": \"Penulis Uji\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Expected: 401."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2G. POST Books - User Biasa Ditolak",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buku Uji\",\n  \"author\": \"Penulis Uji\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Isi collection variable userToken dengan JWT dari akun role=user. Expected: 403."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. POST Loan - Buku Tersedia",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"bookId\": {{availableBookId}}\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans",
        "description": "Alur E2E peminjaman: Gateway -> Loan Service -> Book Service -> Book DB, kemudian Loan DB dan update status buku. Default bookId=2. Expected: 201 jika buku tersedia. Login dahulu dan gunakan JWT Bearer token; username diambil dari token."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (body.loan && body.loan.id !== undefined) pm.environment.set(\"loanId\", String(body.loan.id));",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Peminjaman berhasil atau status penolakan sesuai skenario\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect([201, 400, 401, 404, 409, 502]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3A. POST Loan - API Key Salah",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "wrong-api-key"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"bookId\": {{availableBookId}}\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans",
        "description": "Tanpa JWT yang valid, request tetap ditolak 401 karena endpoint peminjaman wajib JWT. API Key tidak menggantikan JWT; untuk menguji API Key gunakan GET Books dengan API Key salah."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3B. POST Loan - API Key Tidak Dikirim",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"bookId\": {{availableBookId}}\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans",
        "description": "Tanpa JWT yang valid, request ditolak 401 karena endpoint peminjaman wajib JWT. API Key bukan pengganti JWT."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3C. POST Loan - Data Tidak Lengkap",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
