        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"bookId\": {{notFoundBookId}}\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans",
        "description": "Expected: 404 jika ID buku tidak ada."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. GET Loans by Username",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{username}}",
        "description": "JWT wajib dan username path harus sama dengan username pada token. Expected: 200 dan array pinjaman aktif; username lain ditolak 403."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4B. POST Loan - Pengembalian Buku",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{loanId}}/return",
        "description": "Gunakan loanId yang otomatis disimpan oleh request peminjaman berhasil. JWT harus milik peminjam. Expected: 200 dengan loan.status=returned dan returnedAt. Request kedua untuk loanId yang sama expected 409. API Key tidak menggantikan JWT."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Pengembalian menghasilkan status yang diharapkan\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect([200, 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 502]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4A. GET Loans - API Key Salah",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "wrong-api-key"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{username}}",
        "description": "Tanpa JWT valid, expected 401. API Key tidak dapat menggantikan JWT untuk riwayat peminjaman."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Simulasi Book Service Mati - GET Books",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-API-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books",
        "description": "Hentikan Book Service :4001 setelah Gateway berjalan. Expected: 502 dari Gateway. Jangan jalankan bersamaan dengan request normal."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Simulasi Loan Service Mati - GET Loans",
      "request": {
